# Receipt Classification Pipeline - Complete Specification

> **Purpose**: This document provides a complete specification for recreating the Receipt Classification Pipeline in any AI agent framework (e.g., LangChain, AutoGen, CrewAI, Semantic Kernel, etc.)

![Pipeline Diagram](uploaded_media_1769687586563.png)

---

## 🎯 Pipeline Overview

This is a **multi-agent AI pipeline** that processes raw receipt OCR data and:
1. **Classifies** line items into spending categories
2. **Groups** items by category with calculated totals
3. **Validates** that computed totals match the receipt total
4. **Iteratively refines** if validation fails (up to 10 attempts)
5. **Persists** the final result to cloud storage (Firebase)

---

## 📊 Input/Output Specification

### Input Data Format
```json
{
    "line_items": [
        "1 g1 Imp White 7.75",
        "1 Blue Moon Tap 6.00",
        "Mozzarella&Tomato 9.95",
        "Pork Quesadilla 9.95",
        "1 Fren Onion Soup 5.95",
        "1 Pork Chop 21.95",
        "1 Hanger Sizzle 24.95",
        "1 Printer 200.00"
    ],
    "receipt_total_value": {
        "total_amount": "294.18",
        "net_amount": "286.50",
        "total_tax_amount": "7.68"
    },
    "grouped": {
        "net_amount": ["286.50"],
        "total_amount": ["294.18"],
        "total_tax_amount": ["7.68"],
        "currency": ["$"],
        "purchase_time": ["08:22PM"],
        "receipt_date": ["09/24/2016"],
        "supplier_name": ["Nancy"],
        "supplier_phone": ["718.343-4616"],
        "supplier_address": ["255-41 Jericho Turnpike\nFloral Park, NY 11001"],
        "line_item": ["1 g1 Imp White 7.75", "..."],
        "supplier_city": [""]
    }
}
```

### Final Output Format
```json
{
    "categories": [
        {
            "category": "Fast Food",
            "items": ["g1 Imp White", "Blue Moon Tap", "Mozzarella&Tomato", "Pork Quesadilla", "Fren Onion Soup", "Pork Chop", "Hanger Sizzle"],
            "total_price": "86.50"
        },
        {
            "category": "Electronics",
            "items": ["Printer"],
            "total_price": "200.00"
        }
    ]
}
```

