## 🎯 Summary

To recreate this pipeline in another framework, you need:

1. **4 LLM Agents** with specific system prompts (provided above)
2. **4 Tools** that handle computation and storage:
   - [calculate_final_total](file:///c:/Users/JonathanChackoPattas/Desktop/Spendify/adk_pipeline/receipt_classifier/subagents/classification_reviewer/tools.py#5-50) - Sums category totals
   - [exit_function](file:///c:/Users/JonathanChackoPattas/Desktop/Spendify/adk_pipeline/receipt_classifier/subagents/classification_reviewer/tools.py#52-110) - Compares totals and triggers loop exit
   - [save_to_firebase](file:///c:/Users/JonathanChackoPattas/Desktop/Spendify/adk_pipeline/receipt_classifier/subagents/classification_response/tools.py#19-43) - Persists to cloud storage
3. **A Sequential Agent** to orchestrate the pipeline
4. **A Loop Agent** with exit condition support for iterative refinement
5. **Shared State Management** for passing data between agents via output keys
